WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.944
Learn to describe the pattern found in a given table or chart and determine the

00:00:04.944 --> 00:00:07.475
missing element(s) in a given table or chart

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:14.530
Which rule describes the pattern 17, 30, 43, ...? The answer is Add 13. Each next

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.091
term increases by 13.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:22.737
A walking counter records 16, 28, 40 steps. What is the change each time? Pause and

00:00:22.737 --> 00:00:24.907
solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:29.282
The answer is plus 12. Each difference equals 12.
